# UX workflow: Macro performance rail and true clamp feedback.
# Purpose: proves the adjacent signed rail remains sufficient without an Out
# cap, and conflict color appears only while Base + Modulation is clamped.
# Expect: capture_changed:rail_unclipped=rail_clipped, capture_changed:rail_clipped=rail_recovered

0 scenario macro-performance-rail
100 capture screen rail_unclipped

# The long square source stays positive across this short workflow. Raising
# Base crosses the real upper bound; no Depth-only heuristic is involved.
240 encoder MACRO_1 0.90
520 capture screen rail_clipped

# Moving Base back into range restores the ordinary modulation color while the
# source continues to run and the rail remains visible.
660 encoder MACRO_1 -1.00
940 capture screen rail_recovered
